  "articleBody": "When you're selling a luxury property in Orange County, receiving multiple offers is often a great problem to have! But it's still a problem you need to solve strategically. It’s tempting to just pick the highest number, but a smart seller looks at the full picture. There's a lot more to an offer than just the purchase price, and understanding those nuances can save you headaches and maximize your true gain. You're aiming for the most favorable outcome, and that means a holistic evaluation.\n\nWhat Can Change the Right Choice\nSeveral factors can significantly sway which offer is ",
